    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 5</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = 1 - (a + 5) - (-9) + b</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 5</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = 6 - (a + 1) - (-1) + b</span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 5</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = b - a - 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = -2 - (4 - b + a)</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 5</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = b - a - 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">D = -x - y - 3</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">D = (x + z) - x - [3 - (-x - y - z)]</span><br><span class=\"q\">5) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = b - a + 5</span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = b - a + 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = b - a - 6</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">D = -x - y - 3</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = 0</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = -5 - (x - 2) - [-7 - (x - 4)]</span>",
